    "summary": "[Blinding Radiance](vsdata:ability/adepta-sororitas.army-of-faith.blinding-radiance) gets a new Target and Effect. It targets 1 of these units of yours:\n\n- an **ADEPTA SORORITAS INFANTRY** unit that the attacker picked as a target for at least 1 attack\n- an **ADEPTA SORORITAS JUMP PACK** unit no more than 3\" from that **INFANTRY** unit\n\nUntil the end of the phase, attacks against the target unit get -1 to the **Hit roll**. If the target is an **ADEPTA SORORITAS JUMP PACK** unit, for the rest of the phase attacks also get -1 to the Hit roll against each **ADEPTA SORORITAS INFANTRY** unit of yours while it is no more than 3\" from the target unit.",
